OL,3,ABoard of Deputies of British Jews
OL,4,Adeclares Greens to be racist party
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party of England and Wales
OL,7,Fhas been declared a racist organisation
OL,8,Fby the Board of Deputies of British
OL,9,FJews.
OL,11,FThe Jewish body, which is the largest
OL,12,Fin the UK, was responding to the
OL,13,F"Zionism is racism" policy motion
OL,14,Fpassed at the Green Party's conference
OL,15,Fearlier this month.
OL,17,FBoard of Deputies president Phil
OL,18,FRosenberg said a vote passed by 118
OL,19,Fvotes to one to declare that the Greens
OL,20,Fhad, "by adopting an antisemitic
OL,21,Fplatform, become a racist party".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
