OL,3,ABoard of Deputies of British Jews
OL,4,Adeclares Greens to be racist party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesman for the Greens insisted the
OL,7,Fparty does not discriminate against
OL,8,Fpeople who hold Zionist views and said
OL,9,Fit rejected the Board of Deputies'
OL,10,F"characterisation of this motion and
OL,11,Four party".
